  "description": "The G1 GPI – it shares the same DNA as the G1 which is synonymous for its ruggedness, adaptability and performance driven roots. Our goal is to make bikes that last longer and are easier to live with and the G1 GPI adds its own advances in durability, long-term reliability, and minimal maintenance. At the heart of the frame is a PINION C1.12i 12-speed electronically operated gearbox paired with a GATES Carbon Drive belt, ensuring smooth and efficient power transmission to the rear wheel.\n\nThe G1 GPI is best described as a Superenduro-an adaptive gravity platform designed for a wide range of riding styles and conditions. Whether on the enduro race track, downhill course, bike park jumplines, or long alpine adventures, the G1 GPI can be adapted to give you the perfect ride on your perfect trail.",
